% % Bring me sunshine in your smile% %

1213
01:35:04.832 --> 01:35:07.460
% % Bring me laughter% %

1214
01:35:07.535 --> 01:35:09.366
% % All the while% %

1215
01:35:11.105 --> 01:35:14.097
% % Let your arms be as warm% %

1216
01:35:14.175 --> 01:35:16.735
% % As the sun from up above% %

1217
